OL,3,GNEWSAHot weather means more wine, says
OL,4,Avineyard
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the heatwave and the drought have
OL,7,Fnegatively impacted farmers, for one
OL,8,Fvineyard it has led to a bumper crop.
OL,10,FHeather Williamson, the co-founder of
OL,11,FFoxbury Fields on the
OL,12,FGloucestershire-Herefordshire border
OL,13,Fnear Ledbury, said: "I think we've got
OL,14,Ffar more grapes this year than we had
OL,15,Flast year.
OL,17,F"I'm pretty confident that we've done
OL,18,Fat least a tonne and considering we've
OL,19,Fleft out quite a lot of vines that's
OL,20,Fsubstantially more [than usual]."
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
